  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 2763,
      "text": "In fact, We brought them the truth, but they are certainly liars[39].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 90,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2764,
      "text": "Allah has never begotten a son, nor is there any god besides Him. Otherwise, each god would have taken away what he had created, and each would have tried to gain supremacy over the other[40]. Glory be to Allah far above what they ascribe to Him!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 91,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2765,
      "text": "Knower of the unseen and the seen. Exalted is He far above what they associate with Him!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 92,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 299,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2766,
      "text": "Say, “My Lord, if You show me what they[41] are warned of,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 93,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2767,
      "text": "my Lord, then do not include me among the wrongdoing people[42].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 94,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2768,
      "text": "We are surely able to show you that of which We have warned them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 95,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2769,
      "text": "Repel evil with what is best; We know well what they claim[43].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 96,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2770,
      "text": "And say, “My Lord, I seek refuge with You from the temptations of the devils.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2771,
      "text": "And I seek refuge with You, my Lord, that they even come near me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2772,
      "text": "Until when death comes to one of them, he says, “My Lord, send me back,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2773,
      "text": "so that I may do righteous deeds in what I left behind.” No, it is only a word he utters. And behind them is a barrier until the Day they are resurrected[44]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 100,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2774,
      "text": "When the Trumpet is blown[45], there will be no kinship ties between them on that Day, nor will they ask about one another[46].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 101,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2775,
      "text": "So those whose scales [of good deeds] are heavy, it is they who will be successful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 102,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2776,
      "text": "But those whose scales are light, they are the ones who have lost their souls, abiding in Hell forever.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Muminoon",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Believers",
        "numberOfAyahs": 118,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 103,
      "juz": 18,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 348,
      "ruku": 300,
      "hizbQuarter": 139,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2777,
      "text": "The Fire will scorch their faces, leaving them disfigured[47].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 23,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُؤۡمِنُونَ",
